      "version": "1.4.0",
      "description": "<h2>Added</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom models and icons for all five stims — no more reused vanilla donor looks</li>\n<li>APEX — red/orange with circuit accents</li>\n<li>AEGIS — white/green with heartbeat motif</li>\n<li>IRON — gunmetal with heat-tinted cap</li>\n<li>ARGUS — violet/yellow with radar plate</li>\n<li>GRAFT — clinical white/red with dose windows</li>\n<li>Stash icons, inspect view, and in-world models all use the new skins</li>\n<li>New client plugin (<code>CoolerStimsClient.dll</code>) — the custom skins now also show on the injector in your hands during the use animation</li>\n<li>Fixes stims previously showing random vanilla stim skins when used</li>\n<li>New F12 toggle to turn the in-hands skins on/off</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extract the ENTIRE zip into your SPT root folder — both the <code>BepInEx</code> and <code>SPT</code> folders (1.4.0 adds a client half)</li>\n<li>Upgrading from 1.3.0 is safe in place, nothing needs deleting</li>\n</ul>\n",
